meta {
  name: Deactivate member
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admins/members/:userId/deactivate
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  userId: 1
}

docs {
  Admin login (cookie Authentication_Admin): run "Admin auth / Login" first. Sets every card record of the user inactive, so no card verifies. Any admin may deactivate any user's card, whatever their organization. Used with "Admin / Requests / Update status" 15 → 16 to cancel a card, for example before a change of organization (Request Type 11).
}
